              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Points cost and stats as Spartacus's Heroic Leaders. Besides a General, the army may have additional characters representing the heroic leaders of the various slave and peasant groupings. (Spartacus p.42)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
